<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="mn">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>House Sapin — FORAE ARCHITECTS</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root{
    --paper:#ffffff;
    --ink:#161616;
    --graphite:#7a7a75;
    --hairline:#e6e5e0;
    --sans:"Inter", -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;
  }
  *{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box;}
  body{
    background:var(--paper);
    color:var(--ink);
    font-family:var(--sans);
    -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
    -moz-osx-font-smoothing: grayscale;
    display:flex;
    flex-direction:column;
    min-height:100vh;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }
  main{flex:1 0 auto; margin:0 auto; width:100%; max-width:760px;}
  a{color:inherit; text-decoration:none;}

  .header-inner{display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; padding:20px 32px; gap:24px;}
  .logo{font-size:16px; font-weight:500; letter-spacing:0.02em; text-transform:lowercase;}
  nav.primary{display:flex; gap:32px; font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.04em; font-weight:400; text-transform:lowercase;}
  nav.primary a{color:var(--graphite);}
  nav.primary a:hover{color:var(--ink);}

  .page-wrap{padding:48px 32px 0;}

  .back-link{display:inline-block; font-size:12px; color:var(--graphite); margin-bottom:32px;}
  .back-link:hover{color:var(--ink);}

  .project-head h1{font-size:18px; font-weight:500; margin-bottom:4px;}
  .project-head .en-title{font-size:13px; color:var(--graphite); margin-bottom:20px;}

  .meta-table{font-size:13px; line-height:1.9; color:var(--graphite); margin-bottom:36px;}
  .meta-table span.label{display:inline-block; width:70px; color:var(--graphite);}
  .meta-table span.value{color:var(--ink);}

  .project-image{width:100%; margin-bottom:36px;}
  .project-image img{width:100%; height:auto; display:block; background:#161616; cursor:zoom-in;}
  .project-image .caption{font-size:11px; color:var(--graphite); margin-top:8px;}

  /* Lightbox: зураг дээр дарахад томроор харагдах */
  .lightbox{
    position:fixed; inset:0; background:rgba(22,22,22,0.92);
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;
    padding:32px; cursor:zoom-out;
    opacity:0; visibility:hidden; transition:opacity .2s ease;
    z-index:100;
  }
  .lightbox.is-open{opacity:1; visibility:visible;}
  .lightbox img{max-width:100%; max-height:100%; width:auto; height:auto; display:block;}
  .lightbox .lightbox-close{
    position:absolute; top:24px; right:32px; color:#fff; font-size:28px;
    line-height:1; cursor:pointer; font-weight:300;
  }

  .project-text p{font-size:14px; line-height:1.8; color:var(--ink); margin-bottom:14px;}
  .project-text p.en{color:var(--graphite);}

  footer{margin-top:80px; padding:24px 32px 32px; text-align:center;}
  .copyright{font-size:12px; color:var(--graphite);}

  @media (max-width:560px){
    .header-inner{padding:14px 18px; flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; gap: 12px;}
    nav.primary{gap: 16px;}
    .page-wrap{padding:24px 18px 0;}
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
  <div class="header-inner">
    <a class="logo" href="/">forae architects</a>
    <nav class="primary">
      <a href="/practice">practice</a>
      <a href="/contact">contact</a>
      <a href="/news">news</a>
      <a href="/reference">reference</a>
    </nav>
  </div>
</header>

<main>
  <div class="page-wrap">
    <a class="back-link" href="/">&larr; back to projects</a>

    <div class="project-head">
      <h1>House Sapin</h1>
      <p class="en-title">house sapin</p>
    </div>

    <div class="meta-table">
      <p><span class="label">location</span><span class="value">Шаргаморьт, Mongolia</span></p>
      <p><span class="label">year</span><span class="value">2026, 03 — construction in progress</span></p>
      <p><span class="label">use</span><span class="value">single family house</span></p>
      <p><span class="label">area</span><span class="value">60m²</span></p>
    </div>

    <!-- Жинхэнэ зургаа /public/projects/ дотор байрлуулаад доорх src-г солино уу.
         Файлын нэрэнд зай (space) байвал линк эвдэрдэг тул нэрийг зурвасаар холбож бичих нь дээр
         (жишээ нь: sapin-final-01.jpg). -->
    <div class="project-image">
      <img src="/projects/sapin-final-01.jpg" alt="House Sapin — render" class="lightbox-trigger">
      <p class="caption">render, 1:100</p>
    </div>

    <div class="project-text">
      <p>Шаргаморьтын нам гүм газарт байрлах бяцхан дан давхар байшин бөгөөд гэр бүлийн энгийн амьдралын хэмнэлд тулгуурлан төлөвлөгдсөн. Компакт хэмжээ, шулуун бүтэц, орчны газраа хүндэтгэсэн энгийн хэлбэрийг эрхэмлэсэн.</p>
      <p class="en">A small single-storey house set in the quiet surroundings of Shargamort, planned around the plain rhythm of everyday family life. Its compact footprint and straightforward structure respect the modesty of its site.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</main>

<footer>
  <p class="copyright">© 2026 forae architects</p>
</footer>

<!-- Lightbox: том зураг харуулах давхарга -->
<div class="lightbox" id="lightbox">
  <span class="lightbox-close">&times;</span>
  <img id="lightbox-img" src="" alt="">
</div>

<script>
  document.querySelectorAll('.lightbox-trigger').forEach(function (img) {
    img.addEventListener('click', function () {
      var lightbox = document.getElementById('lightbox');
      var lightboxImg = document.getElementById('lightbox-img');
      lightboxImg.src = img.src;
      lightboxImg.alt = img.alt;
      lightbox.classList.add('is-open');
    });
  });

  document.getElementById('lightbox').addEventListener('click', function () {
    this.classList.remove('is-open');
  });

  document.addEventListener('keydown', function (e) {
    if (e.key === 'Escape') {
      document.getElementById('lightbox').classList.remove('is-open');
    }
  });
</script>

</body>
</html>
